  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tương tự <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac dis